    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual Hearts is a cozy short romance story where you play as Bella, a young adult who finds a computer in someone's garbage and decides to take it home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96\u00a0<strong>Memory Mini-Game\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc96</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/a93c69ce0970f031a2b69d7dbf42c11b.poster.avif?t=1748318600\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/a93c69ce0970f031a2b69d7dbf42c11b.webm?t=1748318600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/a93c69ce0970f031a2b69d7dbf42c11b.mp4?t=1748318600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with cute and fun memory mini-games to earn points that unlock premium choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Chat Mechanic</strong>\ud83d\udc96</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/a567282e1d13bf162cabd8e41ddd5079.poster.avif?t=1748318600\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/a567282e1d13bf162cabd8e41ddd5079.webm?t=1748318600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/a567282e1d13bf162cabd8e41ddd5079.mp4?t=1748318600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the characters and make decisions that determine the outcome of your relationships. Text, flirt, and uncover secrets with each love interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Meet Your 3<strong> Love Interests</strong>\ud83d\udc96</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/2aec33e21d2cd7e42f5208210c175c22.avif?t=1748318600\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aiden, the Charming executive</strong> \u2013 A charismatic man with a strategic mind, what's behind his sweet words?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/afa3acc607476b5c5e78ca27642fb4e1.avif?t=1748318600\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caden, the rude detective</strong>\u2013 A rude boy on the outside, but what lies beneath? Discover his true nature as you get to know him</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449450/extras/d9066049b1e99826d5b2b73672c291d7.avif?t=1748318600\" width=620 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ethan, the mysterious private spy</strong> \u2013 Ethan is a tormented soul who lives only to fulfill the missions assigned by his employers. Can you break down his walls and show him the power of kindness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Multiple Endings</strong>\ud83d\udc96 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter! Explore different paths with each character and unlock sweet moments or bittersweet goodbyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
